  "description": "Change of use of the outbuilding to use as a beauty salon",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The premises\r\nshall be used for the purpose specified on the application and for no other\r\npurpose, including any other purpose in Class E of the Schedule to the Town and\r\nCountry Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987 (or in any provision equivalent to\r\nthat Class in any Statutory Instrument revoking and re-enacting that order with\r\nor without modification).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\">The\r\ndevelopment hereby permitted shall be retained in accordance with the following\r\napproved plans and documents:&nbsp; 3317-P-010; 3317-P-001; Site Plan; Letter\r\nfrom MZA planning dated 29h August 2025.<o:p></o:p></p>",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The use hereby\r\npermitted shall be by appointment only and shall not be open to customers\r\noutside the following times:-&amp;nbsp; 11:00 hours to 13:00 hours and 15:00 hours\r\nto 19:00 hours &amp;nbsp;Monday to Saturday, with\r\nno operation on Sundays and Bank holidays, without the prior written permission\r\nof the local planning authority.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;The number of\r\ncustomers waiting and/or in treatment shall not exceed two at any given time,\r\nwithin the hours specified in condition 2.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;line-height: normal;&quot;&gt;Within three months of the date of this permission, the use of the front rooms of the dwellinghouse as a beauty salon must cease to operate and the rooms should be fully reinstated to residential use ancillary to the main dwellinghouse at no.2 Waverley Road, Rayners Lane, Harrow, HA2 9RB.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
